      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Aggregates reviews + routes into IMDF-shaped GeoJSON:\nUnit (walkway/room), Opening (accessible: true/false),\nAmenity (elevator, accessible restroom).\nSelf-hosted \u2014 NOT submitted to Apple, no review needed.\nRegenerates whenever is_stale is set above.",
